+# Proposal 0007: Spacing steps 2.5 (10px) and 3.5 (14px)
+
+- **Status:** ✅ Approved and merged (2026-11-10), decision D-G1 Option A
+- **Method:** read-only gap/padding audit of the login components in the refactor duplicate `PpnTy1pkB2FTZFq6i6seSy` (make-ds2-workspace `scripts/components/gap-spacing-audit.js`, report `reports/component-readiness/gap-spacing-coverage.md`).
+- **Files:** `tokens/primitives/spacing.tokens.json`: 2 entries added (`spacing.2_5`, `spacing.3_5`). No other key, value, alias or type changes.
+
+## Why
+
+198 Auto Layout values in the login components are hardcoded at 10px or 14px, values that exist nowhere in the registry or in Figma:
+
+| Where | Field | Value | Count |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Button root, md | padding top/bottom | 10 | 120 |
+| Button root, md | padding left/right | 14 | 36 |
+| Input field `optional` tag | gap | 10 | 41 |
+| `_Modal header` `Content/wrapper` | gap | 10 | 1 |
+
+They are inherited Untitled UI values (button md = 10 × 14). Option A keeps them unchanged and makes them tokens.
+
+## Tokens
+
+| Token | Value | Tailwind | Figma primitive | Figma semantic alias (`3. Spacing`) |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `spacing.2_5` | 10px | `--spacing × 2.5` (`p-2.5`, `gap-2.5`) | `spacing/2_5` | `spacing-2_5` |
+| `spacing.3_5` | 14px | `--spacing × 3.5` (`px-3.5`) | `spacing/3_5` | `spacing-3_5` |
+
+Key style follows the existing fractional steps (`0_5`, `1_5`): `_` in the key, `.` in the Tailwind class.
+
+## Alternatives
+
+- **B:** document 10/14 as exceptions (no token). Rejected: leaves 198 unbound values.
+- **C:** snap to 8/12/16. Rejected: changes Button and Input layout.
+- Role names (`gap-tight` / `gap-default` / `gap-loose`): not added (explicitly excluded by D-G1).
+
+## Validation
+
+- `npm run validate`: ✔ primitives 118 → 120, semantic and themes unchanged (8 / 11 / 11)
+- `npm run check`: 29/29 tests pass before and after
+- `dist/` diff (`build:paper-kit`, light and dark): only `spacing.2_5` and `spacing.3_5` added; 137 → 139 resolved tokens; none removed or changed (apart from `builtAt`)
+- Naming collision checks C1–C13: unchanged
+- Tailwind 4.3.5 compile (workspace `scripts/naming/compile-check.mjs`, scenario S5): `p-2.5` → `padding: calc(var(--spacing) * 2.5)`, `px-3.5` → `padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing) * 3.5)`, `gap-2.5`, `gap-3.5`, `py-2.5` likewise; existing `p-0.5`, `p-1.5`, `p-2`, `p-3`, `px-4`, `gap-1` unchanged; no per-step variable emitted. 60/60.
+
+## Approval
+
+Mike, 2026-11-10: "MAKE DS2 — D-G1 Approved: Spacing Coverage. I approve Option A for D-G1." Alias names `spacing-2_5` / `spacing-3_5` chosen by Mike the same day.
